		},
		{
			"id": "d0397981fb694dc0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 驗證方式很簡單如果是負數的話那麼你全部皆最高位數，然後 1 to 0, 0 to 1 然後最後加 1，就會得到原本的直再加上正負，所以可以這樣用",
			"x": -978,
			"y": 1800,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 87,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "fd1d23234ca9908f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_3_Unit_construction/08-ALU Control Unit - ALU Control K-map 化簡過程.png",
			"x": 2720,
			"y": -1565,
			"width": 575,
			"height": 320
		},
		{
			"id": "81c02b75d40c5267",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# 多層控制 multiple levels of control\n\n**核心觀念**  \n用多個較小的控制器分工：Main Control 處理高階指令型態，ALU Control 決定具體 ALU 動作。可縮小主控器邏輯，潛在縮短關鍵路徑並提升時脈。\n\n**資料流與介面**\n\n```\nopcode ──► Main Control ──► {RegDst, Branch, MemRead, MemWrite,\n                               MemtoReg, RegWrite, ALUSrc, ALUOp}\n                                          │\n                               funct + ALUOp ──► ALU Control ──► ALU操作碼\n```\n\n**職責分工**\n\n- Main Control：只看 `opcode`，輸出高階控制訊號與精簡 `ALUOp`。\n    \n- ALU Control：以 `ALUOp` + R-type `funct`，產生 ALU 的最終操作碼。\n    \n\n**常見對應（MIPS 範例）**\n\n- `ALUOp=00` → `ADD`（`lw/sw` 位址計算）\n    \n- `ALUOp=01` → `SUB`（`beq` 比較）\n    \n- `ALUOp=10` + `funct`：`100000`→ADD，`100010`→SUB，`100100`→AND，`100101`→OR，`101010`→SLT\n    \n\n**優缺點**\n\n- 優點：主控器面積更小、邏輯深度較淺、模組化易擴充。\n    \n- 代價：多一級邏輯與介面協定，需小心時序與解碼延遲。\n    \n",
			"x": 2080,
			"y": -3790,
			"width": 759,
			"height": 710
		},
		{
			"id": "f8b2be427b2a1c8f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# ALU Control K-map 化簡過程\n\n---\n\n## Operation3\n\n- **需求**：所有指令的輸出此位 = 0。\n    \n- **K-map**：全 0，僅 A1A0=11 為 don’t care。\n    \n- **化簡**：`Op3 = 0`\n    \n\n---\n\n## Operation2 (依 A0、A1、F1)\n\n- **需求**：\n    \n    - lw/sw (00) → 0\n        \n    - beq (01) → 1\n        \n    - R-type (10) → 只有 sub/slt (F1=1) 才是 1\n        \n    - A1A0=11 → don’t care\n        \n- **K-map (列=A1A0，欄=F1F0)**\n    \n\n```\n            F1F0\n           00  01  11  10\nA1A0=00     0   0   0   0\nA1A0=01     1   1   1   1\nA1A0=11     x   x   x   x\nA1A0=10     0   0   1   1\n```\n\n- **分組**：\n    \n    - 整列 A1A0=01 (含 11 的 x) → A0\n        \n    - A1A0=10 且 F1=1 (01,11) → A1·F1\n        \n- **化簡**：`Op2 = A0 + (A1·F1)`\n    \n\n---\n\n## Operation1 (依 A1、F2)\n\n- **需求**：\n    \n    - lw/sw (00) → 1\n        \n    - beq (01) → 1\n        \n    - R-type (10)：add/sub/slt (F2=0) → 1；and/or (F2=1) → 0\n        \n    - A1A0=11 → don’t care\n        \n- **K-map (列=A1A0，欄=F3F2)**\n    \n\n```\n            F3F2\n           00  01  11  10\nA1A0=00     1   1   1   1\nA1A0=01     1   1   1   1\nA1A0=11     x   x   x   x\nA1A0=10     1   0   0   1\n```\n\n- **分組**：\n    \n    - 上兩行全 1 → A1′\n        \n    - R-type 列中 F2=0 的兩格 → F2′\n        \n- **化簡**：`Op1 = A1′ + F2′`\n    \n\n---\n\n## Operation0 (依 A1、F3、F0)\n\n- **需求**：\n    \n    - lw/sw、beq → 0\n        \n    - R-type：or(F0=1) → 1；slt(F3=1) → 1；其餘 0\n        \n    - A1A0=11 → don’t care\n        \n- **K-map (列=A1A0，欄=F3F0)**\n    \n\n```\n            F3F0\n           00  01  11  10\nA1A0=00     0   0   0   0\nA1A0=01     0   0   0   0\nA1A0=11     x   x   x   x\nA1A0=10     0   1   0   1\n```\n\n- **分組**：\n    \n    - (10,01) 與 (11,01 x) → A1·F0\n        \n    - (10,10) 與 (11,10 x) → A1·F3\n        \n- **化簡**：`Op0 = A1·F0 + A1·F3 = A1·(F0 + F3)`\n    \n\n---\n\n# 總結布林函數\n\n```\nOp3 = 0\nOp2 = A0 + (A1·F1)\nOp1 = ¬A1 + ¬F2\nOp0 = A1·(F0 + F3)\n```",
			"x": 3520,
			"y": -2130,
			"width": 606,
			"height": 2201
		},
		{
			"id": "7c607575fd210087",
